# The boot guard options are defined once, in the app component, so they reach
# the project's sdkconfig: the bootloader subproject reads that file but only
# keeps symbols its own Kconfig tree knows. Defining them only here left every
# option at its default in the bootloader (measured: CONFIG_BOOTGUARD_ACTION_HALT=y
# in the app's sdkconfig.defaults built a bootloader with ACTION_DOWNLOAD).
rsource "../../components/bootguard/Kconfig"
